<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- 火巨人的炉火 -->
  <LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.0.label>the fire giant's forge fire</LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.0.label>
  <!-- 那个火巨人身上总有烧焦的气味，火焰是巨魔天生的克星。 -->
  <LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.0.description>That fire giant always smells of burning; fire is the natural bane of trolls.</LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.0.description>
  <!-- 习惯了炉火 -->
  <LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.1.label>used to the forge fire</LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.1.label>
  <!-- 和火巨人相处久了，那股焦味反而让人觉得踏实。 -->
  <LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.1.description>After living with fire giants long enough, the smell of burning actually feels reassuring.</LP_RacialRelation_TrollFireGiant.stages.1.description>
</LanguageData>
